    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Detroit-based multimedia artist / interaction designer, known as Polyhop for a 8+ year daily TouchDesigner generative-art practice (125K IG followers). Real-time generative visuals, interactive installations, audiovisual performance, plus sound/music composition. Work shown at Coachella, Electric Forest, Ann Arbor Film Festival and the 2020 Shenzhen Bi-City Biennale; as part of ARTECHOUSE created work with NASA, Nobel Prize Museum and HARPA. MA Media Arts, U Michigan (2015), where he has also taught. Senior independent artist-technologist, ~10+ yrs; runs his own Polyhop LLC and freelances while collaborating with ARTECHOUSE. Freelance: site and IG present an independent practice, LinkedIn lists Polyhop LLC owner plus an ARTECHOUSE role (treated as collaboration, not sole employer). Fully autonomous (5). Instagram @polyhop confirmed: simonaa.media links to it directly as his handle. Email simon@simonaa.media confirmed from simonaa.media/about. LinkedIn confirmed via Google snippet (simonalexanderadams). No public Open Questions.",
